Z||000003||Adrift||11-16-2001||05:27 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Shoot down the 401 west towards london ways (its not far though  ... Exit on Highway 25 in milton, and head south on 25 past the macdonalds, past the opp station... Its on your right hand side (about 1 km off the highway) ... Check their hours.. there are a few days they are not open, but I know they are open friday and sat ...<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Just got the phone number /address for an ad I found in "Canadian automotive performance" - 250 Martin St. Milton, Ontario 905-878-6853<P>Open 9-6 Mon, Wed, Fri, Sat<p>[This message has been edited by Adrift (edited 11-16-2001).]||||reg||1
